OL,3,GNEWSATrial date set after mother killed
OL,4,Aas she slept
OL,5,
OL,6,FA trial date has been set for a man who
OL,7,Fis accused of breaking into the home of
OL,8,Fa mother and fatally stabbing her as
OL,9,Fshe slept in bed with her husband and
OL,10,Fthree-month-old baby.
OL,12,FDaniel Sean James, 44, is alleged to
OL,13,Fhave attacked Kirandeep Kaur, 24, in
OL,14,Fher home on Uxbridge Road in Hayes,
OL,15,Fwest London, in the early hours of 12
OL,16,FJuly.
OL,18,FHe is charged with her murder and is
OL,19,Fcurrently being held in custody. James
OL,20,Fwas due to appear at Isleworth Crown
OL,21,FCourt on Monday, but he was not
OL,22,Fpresent.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
